  if printer_firmware_found else -> n6
  Narrator: An RJ45 ethernet port on the wall, labeled 'PRINTER DIRECT — IT USE ONLY.' Alex's instructions said to plug in here with the firmware disk loaded.
  Andrew: Let's see what you've been computing for twenty-two years.
  set printer_soul_done
  goto n7

  @n5
