scene unauthorized_patch_monitor
  if patch_monitor_silenced -> n4
  if final_patch_started else -> n5
  Narrator: A network monitoring terminal near rack row three. The screen shows a live feed of all server activity, with a bright red 'ALERT THRESHOLD' bar at 40% capacity.
  set patch_monitor_silenced
  goto n6

  @n4
  Narrator: The monitoring process is terminated. Screen dark. No alerts will go out tonight.
  goto n6

  @n5
  Narrator: A network monitoring terminal. It logs all server activity and reports anything unusual to corporate IT. The fan hums quietly.

  @n6
  end
